TweetNaCl is a public domain crypto library.

  https://tweetnacl.cr.yp.to/

Authors: Daniel J. Bernstein, Bernard van Gastel, Wesley Janssen,
Tanja Lange, Peter Schwabe, Sjaak Smetsers.

The authors have dedicated TweetNaCl to the public domain. To the extent
possible under law, the authors have waived all copyright and related or
neighboring rights to TweetNaCl.

Vendored into NukeX for Ed25519 signature verification (crypto_sign_open)
and SHA-512 (crypto_hash) only. Sources are unmodified; NukeX supplies the
randombytes() definition that TweetNaCl declares extern, because
verification never needs entropy. See
src/lib/calibration/src/ed25519_verify.cpp.
